== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The bonus granted by this spell consists of +5 [[deflection bonus]], +5 [[dodge bonus]], +5 [[armor bonus]], and +5 [[natural armor bonus]]. The deflection, armor, and natural bonuses do not [[stack]] with bonuses of the same type.
** The sole type of armor class bonus not granted by this spell is a [[shield bonus]].
* This spell often has no effect other than the +5 dodge bonus, due to epic characters frequently possessing +5 or better equipment. However, a character who [[polymorph]]s after casting this spell usually benefits from the full +20 as item bonuses are lost during arcane polymorphs.

'''See also:''' ''[[epic warding]]'' (the other epic defensive spell)

